flowchart TD
    A[Customer report received] --> B[Client proposes a hypothesis]
    B --> C[Trace the path layer by layer:<br/>write path -> data sync -> route access control]
    C --> D{Evidence supports<br/>the hypothesis?}
    D -->|No, at every layer| E[Hypothesis ruled out with evidence]
    E --> F[Continue tracing until an actual<br/>divergence point is found]
    F --> G[Root cause identified]
    D -->|Yes| G
    G --> H[Explain root cause in plain terms]
    H --> I[Give a concrete diagnostic question<br/>to disambiguate from user error]
    I --> J[Recommend fix, scoped separately<br/>from the immediate diagnosis]
